<div class="container">

    <h1>NetAura VPN</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">Account Deletion • Effective May 4, 2026</div>

    <p>
        If you use <span class="highlight">NetAura VPN</span> and want your account and associated backend data deleted,
        you can request deletion by contacting:
    </p>

    <div class="box">
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> <span class="email">contact.topleveldevelopers@gmail.com</span></p>
        <p><strong>Subject:</strong> NetAura VPN Account Deletion Request</p>
    </div>

    <p>Please include enough information to identify your account:</p>

    <ul>
        <li>App name: NetAura VPN</li>
        <li>Your VPN account ID (if available)</li>
        <li>Email or contact method for confirmation</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What happens after your request</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>We review and verify your request where necessary</li>
        <li>We delete or anonymize backend account data when no longer required</li>
        <li>You can remove local data by uninstalling the app or clearing storage</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Retention exceptions</h2>
    <p>
        Some limited data may be retained for legal obligations, fraud prevention,
        abuse prevention, dispute handling, or security investigations.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
        Contact: <span class="email">contact.topleveldevelopers@gmail.com</span>
    </p>

